OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with some patchy
OL,6,Flight rain. Cloud breaks through the
OL,7,Fday with sunny spells and any rain
OL,8,Fbecoming limited to coastal showers.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average. Breezy in
OL,10,Fplaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear and dry evening and
OL,13,Fnight is expected for most areas
OL,14,Fallowing a widespread frost to
OL,15,Fdevelop. The odd mist and fog patch is
OL,16,Fpossible. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
