OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cold and clear start to
OL,6,Fthe day across the region. Remaining
OL,7,Fcold for most areas away from the
OL,8,Fcoast despite the sunshine. Light
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FRemaining cold overnight with frosts
OL,13,Flikely but cloudier by day and
OL,14,Ftemperatures recovering through Sunday
OL,15,Fand Monday. Strengthening winds and
OL,16,Fpotential for rain during Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
